flowchart TD
    Policy[ONE existing FieldPolicy marker membership result] --> Split[PERSON admission / current friendly ownership and rear-place policy]
    Split --> Aboard[Exclude actual CARRIER-held people from loose presentation]
    Aboard --> Facts[Keyed detached current person facts for supplied IDs]
    Facts --> Living[Assignment not DEAD / provisional 1.8m static human]
    Facts --> Nonliving[Actual DEAD permitted identity / abstract cue only]
    Terrain[Existing terrain ground at actual planar position] --> Anchor[One actual-ID ground anchor]
    Living --> Anchor
    Nonliving --> Anchor
    Move[Actual affected entity/person or cached parent event] --> Facts
    Dependencies[Keyed ancestor IDs / affected dependents only] --> Move
    Pose[One sampled neutral bone pose / dispose transient animator] --> Living
    Anchor --> Cue[Cached fixed-pixel RTS cue / same18px inspection anchor]
    Camera[Pan / zoom / viewport / view events] --> Project[Reproject cached anchors only]
    Project --> Cue
    Contact[CONTACT report coordinates / confidence] --> Existing[Existing abstract contacts / place and carrier proxies unchanged]
    Exit[World/model replacement] --> Release[Disconnect old bindings / remove ID references before free]
    Release --> Anchor
    Deferred[Designer8Nov solid contact deferred / production query-only] -. no collision or contact code .-> Living
    Zoom[Approved correction: wheel min10 / max6500 / same pitch and height] --> Camera
    Project --> Near[Cached size<=40 / hollow nearcue; far drawing unchanged]
    Near --> Cue
    Prior[Original functional PASS / visual NOT accepted / exact images retained] --> Zoom
